<AddOnInstructionDefinitions Use="Context">
<AddOnInstructionDefinition Use="Target" Name="I_AB56IF16H" Revision="3.1" RevisionExtension="02 Release" Vendor="Rockwell Automation" ExecutePrescan="true" ExecutePostscan="false" ExecuteEnableInFalse="false" CreatedDate="2013-11-25T18:04:36.444Z" CreatedBy="Not Available" EditedDate="2014-09-30T19:54:27.535Z"
 EditedBy="PROCESS\Library" SoftwareRevision="v18.02">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Allen-Bradley 1756-IF16H
HART AI Module]]>
</Description>
<RevisionNote>
<![CDATA[See V3.1-xx Release Notes for details. Modified MSG error / no HART data available handling.]]>
</RevisionNote>
<AdditionalHelpText>
<![CDATA[Copyright © Rockwell Automation, Inc.  All Rights Reserved.

This instruction takes the input structure for the 1756-IF16H and
copies the data into individual structures for each of the sixteen
input channels. These structures are then used by the
I_AB56IFXH_CHAN instruction to provide error checking and
diagnostic information for each individual HART device.
]]>
</AdditionalHelpText>
